<title>CHINA: China Merchant Bank sets US$100 million FRN.</title>
<headline>China Merchant Bank sets US$100 million FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p>BORROWER CHINA MERCHANT BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$100 MLN  COUPON     6ML+70 BP MATURITY  DUE.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 RE-OFFER  --</p>
<p> PUTS     YR 5	  CALLS	YR 5	LAUNCH    15.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING  LUXEMBOURG  REPAYMENT  BULLET    REPLIES   17.JUL.97</p>
<p> RATING   *	     SALES LMTS STANDARD  DENOMS US$1K,10K,100K</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	   CRS DEF    YES	 FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH     HOME CTRY  CHINA     PAY DATE  31.JUL.97</p>
<p> FEES     43 BP</p>
<p>SOLE LEAD MGR  SBC WARBURG</p>
<p> NOTES    THE ISSUER IS RATED BAA3 BY MOODY'S INVESTORS SERVICE</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
